description: The app must work with networking fully disabled
alwaysApply: true
---

# Offline only

The shipped exe has no network. Anything fetched at runtime fails silently (black scene, missing font).

Bad:
```tsx
<Environment preset="city" />
<Text font="https://fonts.gstatic.com/..." />
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/...');
```

Good:
```tsx
<Environment resolution={256} frames={1}>{/* <Lightformer /> meshes */}</Environment>
// Text lives in the DOM with system fonts (Segoe UI, Nirmala UI for Bangla)
```

Run `npm run audit:offline` before declaring done.
